<title>USA: Simpson Cty, Miss., won by Deposit Guaranty National Bank. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Simpson Cty, Miss., won by Deposit Guaranty National Bank. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deposit Guaranty National Bank said it won $2.25 million of Simpson Cty, Miss., general obligation road and bridge bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.975 percent.</p>
<p>(Corrects name of winner to Deposit Guaranty National Bank from Duncan Williams and corrects the interest cost to 4.975 from 5.10.)</p>
</text>
